.TH "intel_upload_blit_large_map" "1" "2016-03-01" "igt-gpu-tools 2.5" "General Commands Manual"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
intel_upload_blit_large_map \- Microbenchmark of Intel GPU performance
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBintel_upload_blit_large_map\fP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBintel_upload_blit_large_map\fP is a microbenchmark tool for DRM performance.
It should be run with kernel modesetting enabled, and may require root privilege
for correct operation. It does not require X to be running.
.sp
Given that it is a microbenchmark, its utility is largely for regression testing
of the kernel, and not for general conclusions on graphics performance.
.SH "گزارش باگ‌ها (REPORTING BUGS)"
.sp
Report bugs on fd.o GitLab: \%<https://\:gitlab\:.freedesktop\:.org/\:drm/\:igt-gpu-tools/\:-/\:issues>
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
IGT Developers <igt-dev@lists.freedesktop.org>
